{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫花旦陳曉華（Hera）、阮浩棕及錢嘉樂今日（22日）為12月5日舉行的《歡樂滿東華2026》進行拜神儀式及為當晚的「飛車遊繩特技排」環節進行排練，錢嘉樂除擔任表演環節的技術總指導外，屆時又為阮浩棕駕駛特技車，可謂身兼多職。</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:43:49.935454+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T11:41:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T12:37:14.512978+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:37:14.512978+00:00","content_hash":"069b211210b806a826c7ee51f4f472e5f7aa187dd143db8bada5616cdf0b6909","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}